sequenceDiagram
    participant L as Learner
    participant API as Backend
    participant X as Extract & chunk
    participant I as BM25 index
    participant R as ModelRouter
    participant M as Compact / Large model
    L->>API: Upload PDF / DOCX / TXT / MD
    API->>X: extract text per page, sentence-aware chunks (~700 chars, overlap)
    X-->>API: chunks (page, idx, text) are stored, file bytes discarded
    L->>API: Ask a question (tutor or document page)
    API->>I: BM25 search (Arabic/French/English tokenizer)
    I-->>API: top-k passages with scores
    API->>R: rag_answer(question, passages)
    R->>R: tier = compact if 1 high-score passage & short question, else large
    R->>M: prompt = system rules + numbered passages + question (cache checked first)
    M-->>R: JSON {answer_md with [n] citations, used_sources}
    R-->>API: answer + ai metadata
    API-->>L: answer, cited passages (page + excerpt), tier badge, notice if degraded
